Bartending/Cocktails/Greyhound:
The Greyhound is a Highball drink made with Vodka and Grapefruit Juice. The "traditional" method for making a highball is;

Fill the highball glass completely with ice. Then add;

1 oz. Vodka

2 oz. Grapefruit Juice

Add a sip stick. No garnishment is needed.

