Bartending/Cocktails/Lychee Martini:
{{qr-twwp}}
The '''Lychee Martini''' is a cocktail made of Lychee Liqueur (such as Lichido or Soho), Vodka and a dash of Lime Juice. To make it less strong and more fruity, you may add lychee juice to the recipe.  The ideal garnish for this cocktail is a single pitted lychee nut.  But most anything will do. And it tastes great!

