Bartending/Cocktails/Orgasm:
{{barwork}}
An Orgasm is an alcoholic beverage, more specifically a shot/shooter. It is served in a one ounce shot glass. It consists of 1/2 ounce peppermint schnapps and 1/2 ounce Bailey's Irish Cream.

